    "dark-souls": [["Chosen Undead","ds-chosen","An Undead pilgrim exploring Lordran in search of an answer to the curse and the fading First Flame."],["Solaire of Astora","solaire","A knight of Astora seeking his own sun, offering friendship and cooperation along the journey."],["Gwyn, Lord of Cinder","cast-darksouls-gwyn-lord-of-cinder","The ancient lord whose sacrifice to sustain the First Flame shaped the fate of Lordran."],["Siegmeyer of Catarina","cast-darksouls-siegmeyer-of-catarina","A good-natured knight whose adventurous spirit repeatedly carries him into difficult situations."],["Andre of Astora","cast-darksouls-andre-of-astora","A dedicated blacksmith who helps travelers strengthen and adapt their weapons."]],
