    "dark-souls-iii": [["Soul of Cinder","ds-cinder","A powerful guardian of the First Flame embodying the legacy of those who linked the fire."],["Fire Keeper","fire-keeper","The caretaker of Firelink Shrine, helping the Ashen One draw strength from collected souls."],["Ludleth of Courland","cast-darksouls-ludleth-of-courland","A Lord of Cinder who remains at Firelink Shrine and can transform powerful souls into equipment."],["Siegward of Catarina","cast-darksouls-siegward-of-catarina","A friendly knight whose journey through Lothric is guided by loyalty and an important promise."],["Anri of Astora","cast-darksouls-anri-of-astora","An Undead knight traveling toward a personal confrontation, accompanied by the quiet warrior Horace."]]
